    {
      "source": "Delegate for configuration integration to reuse the general way of detecting repositories. Customization is done by\nproviding a configuration format specific <a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationSource</code></a> (currently either XML or annotations\nare supported). The actual registration can then be triggered for different <a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationExtension</code></a>\ns.",
      "translation": "委托配置集成以复用通用的仓库检测方式。自定义通过提供特定于配置的格式来实现，该格式由<a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationSource</code></a>接口定义（目前支持 XML 或注解）。随后，可以针对不同的<a href=\"RepositoryConfigurationExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationExtension</code></a>触发实际的注册。",
      "count": 1
    },
